{"id":10094,"date":"2021-12-16T13:17:11","date_gmt":"2021-12-16T13:17:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=10094"},"modified":"2021-12-16T13:28:24","modified_gmt":"2021-12-16T13:28:24","slug":"do-nanosveta-s-radou-modularnich-mikroskopu-neascope","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/do-nanosveta-s-radou-modularnich-mikroskopu-neascope\/","title":{"rendered":"Do nanosv\u011bta s \u0159adou modul\u00e1rn\u00edch mikroskop\u016f neaSCOPE"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Po p\u0159evratn\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/products\/neasnom-microscope-platform\/\"><strong>mikroskopu neaSNOM<\/strong><\/a>, kter\u00fd stovk\u00e1m v\u011bdeck\u00fdch t\u00fdm\u016f po cel\u00e9m sv\u011bt\u011b p\u0159ibl\u00ed\u017eil nanosv\u011bt s\u00a0<strong>prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm 10 nm<\/strong>, p\u0159ich\u00e1z\u00ed modul\u00e1rn\u00ed <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/ftir-spektroskopie\/neaspec\/\">\u0159ada mikroskop\u016f neaSCOPE<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>D\u00edky sofistikovan\u00e9mu syst\u00e9mu vz\u00e1jemn\u011b kompatibiln\u00edch modul\u016f m\u016f\u017eete nyn\u00ed va\u0161i laborato\u0159 roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159it o syst\u00e9m uzp\u016fsoben\u00fd pro va\u0161i aplikaci, kter\u00fd je nejen ekonomicky v\u00fdhodn\u00fd, ale tak\u00e9 poskytuje pr\u00e1v\u011b to, co pro v\u00e1\u0161 v\u00fdzkum pot\u0159ebujete. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/products\/neaspec-microscopes\/\"><strong>\u0158ada neaSCOPE<\/strong><\/a> nab\u00edz\u00ed:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u0161irokop\u00e1sm\u00e9 lasery pokr\u00fdvaj\u00edc\u00ed oblast od viditeln\u00e9ho a\u017e po THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed<\/li>\n<li>laditeln\u00e9 lasery ve viditeln\u00e9 oblasti<\/li>\n<li>buzen\u00fd (pump) laser pro ultrarychlou spektroskopii<\/li>\n<li>modul pro AFM-IR, nano-imaging, nanospektroskopii, transmisn\u00ed a reflektan\u010dn\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed<\/li>\n<li>modul pro TERS a fotoluminiscen\u010dn\u00ed spektroskopii (nano-PL)<\/li>\n<li>kryogenn\u00ed modul<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Jednotliv\u00e9 syst\u00e9my jsou nav\u00edc roz\u0161i\u0159iteln\u00e9 o dal\u0161\u00ed moduly. Spolu se skute\u010dn\u011b u\u017eivatelsky p\u0159\u00edv\u011btiv\u00fdm softwarem tak p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed nov\u00fd pohled do nanosv\u011bta. Mikroskopy \u0159ady neaSCOPE jsou vhodn\u00e9 pro <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/veda-vyzkum-skolstvi\/\"><strong>\u0159adu aplikac\u00ed z\u00a0oblast\u00ed<\/strong><\/a>:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>nanotechnologi\u00ed (nanodr\u00e1ty, nanoant\u00e9ny, uhl\u00edkat\u00e9 nanomateri\u00e1ly a dal\u0161\u00ed)<\/li>\n<li>p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00edch v\u011bd (studium bakteri\u00ed a vir\u016f, tk\u00e1n\u00ed, protein\u016f a dal\u0161\u00edch biomolekul<\/li>\n<li>polovodi\u010d\u016f<\/li>\n<li>v\u00fdzkumu vlnovod\u016f, grafenu a plazmon\u016f<\/li>\n<li>polymer\u016f a dal\u0161\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/li>\n<li>anorganick\u00e9 chemie (anal\u00fdza kostn\u00ed tk\u00e1n\u011b, slo\u017een\u00ed kosmick\u00fdch t\u011bles a dal\u0161\u00ed)<\/li>\n<li>fotoniky (nap\u0159. v\u00fdvoj integrovan\u00fdch obvod\u016f)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Podrobnosti o vybran\u00fdch aplikac\u00edch se <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/application\/e-book-nanoscale-analysis-of-inorganic-materials\/\">dozv\u00edte zde<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Po p\u0159evratn\u00e9m mikroskopu neaSNOM, kter\u00fd stovk\u00e1m v\u011bdeck\u00fdch t\u00fdm\u016f po cel\u00e9m sv\u011bt\u011b p\u0159ibl\u00ed\u017eil nanosv\u011bt s\u00a0prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm 10 nm, p\u0159ich\u00e1z\u00ed modul\u00e1rn\u00ed \u0159ada mikroskop\u016f neaSCOPE. D\u00edky sofistikovan\u00e9mu syst\u00e9mu vz\u00e1jemn\u011b kompatibiln\u00edch modul\u016f m\u016f\u017eete nyn\u00ed va\u0161i laborato\u0159 roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159it o syst\u00e9m uzp\u016fsoben\u00fd pro va\u0161i aplikaci, kter\u00fd je nejen ekonomicky v\u00fdhodn\u00fd, ale tak